{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5652","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5652/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5652/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5652/events","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/5652","id":191357643,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxOTEzNTc2NDM=","number":5652,"title":"Allow :lmap and 'keymap' translations during macro replay","user":{"login":"hardenedapple","id":4070620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzA2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4070620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple","html_url":"https://github.com/hardenedapple","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hardenedapple/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":154310492,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTQzMTA0OTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/labels/bug-vim","name":"bug-vim","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"wrong behavior inherited from vim"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/6","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/milestone/6","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/6/labels","id":655037,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjU1MDM3","number":6,"title":"backlog","description":"Low priority items. We plan to work on this but don't have a target date.","creator":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":640,"closed_issues":761,"state":"open","created_at":"2014-05-10T20:43:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T21:14:43Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2016-11-23T19:10:17Z","updated_at":"2018-05-17T00:14:05Z","closed_at":"2018-05-17T00:14:05Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"As documented in `:help language-mapping`, `:lmap` mappings are never applied to already mapped characters, so that:\r\n```\r\n:set iminsert=1<CR>\r\n:lnoremap a l<CR>\r\n:nmap x iaaa<CR>\r\nx\r\n```\r\ninserts `aaa` into the buffer.\r\n\r\nThe way this is implemented means that macros ignore these :lmap mappings too, which is not intuitive, as then replaying a macro acts differently to what happened when recording it.\r\n\r\n```\r\n:set iminsert=1<CR>\r\n:lnoremap a l<CR>\r\nqaiaaa<CR><Esc>q@a\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou see two lines in the file, the first one is `lll` and the second one is `aaa`.\r\nSimilar happens for search patterns when 'imsearch' is either -1 or 1, and also for f/F t/T.\r\n\r\nIf you do the same with an :imap you get two lines of lll, I believe it would be less surprising if :lmap and 'keymap' follow this behaviour.\r\n\r\nI have tried the above with the below change applied, and see what I expect to see. It doesn't break any tests on my machine.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/nvim/getchar.c b/src/nvim/getchar.c\r\nindex ab52ee0..76492ab 100644\r\n--- a/src/nvim/getchar.c\r\n+++ b/src/nvim/getchar.c\r\n@@ -1787,7 +1787,8 @@ static int vgetorpeek(int advance)\r\n               if (mp->m_keys[0] == c1\r\n                   && (mp->m_mode & local_State)\r\n                   && ((mp->m_mode & LANGMAP) == 0\r\n-                      || typebuf.tb_maplen == 0)) {\r\n+                      || typebuf.tb_maplen == 0\r\n+                      || Exec_reg == TRUE)) {\r\n                 int nomap = nolmaplen;\r\n                 int c2;\r\n                 /* find the match length of this mapping */\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5652/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}